WEBVTT

00:00.910 --> 00:02.020
According to our records,

00:02.020 --> 00:05.650
the Manga Club has not met the requirements
of a club for the past three years.

00:06.060 --> 00:10.110
This was overlooked while the club
building still had free rooms.

00:10.110 --> 00:12.580
Since three years ago?!

00:13.170 --> 00:15.650
You are the club president,
but you didn't know this?

00:15.650 --> 00:16.290
At any rate...

00:17.130 --> 00:20.520
We ask you to vacate
this club room to the new club.

00:23.070 --> 00:25.550
If you have any questions,

00:25.550 --> 00:27.970
you can find us
in the student council office.

00:40.240 --> 00:42.410
We'll lose our club room?

01:06.550 --> 01:13.470
2.5 DIMENSIONAL SEDUCTION

02:12.990 --> 02:17.990
#7 WE NEED AN ADVISOR

02:21.190 --> 02:23.310
S-Senior...

02:24.990 --> 02:28.000
Senior?! What's that look on your face?!

02:28.330 --> 02:29.390
I'm confused...

02:29.390 --> 02:31.630
This is no time to be confused!

02:32.010 --> 02:33.290
Snap out of it!

02:33.290 --> 02:34.840
Final Fantasy cure!

02:37.370 --> 02:41.580
R-Right! This is no time to be confused!

02:41.580 --> 02:42.770
What should we do?!

02:43.210 --> 02:46.110
Vacating the room means...
The stuff and the books!

02:46.110 --> 02:48.780
We need to evacuate
all doujinshi and figurines!

02:48.780 --> 02:51.070
But such a large number of books...!

02:51.070 --> 02:53.360
LILIEL CRY
Should we donate them to the library?

02:53.360 --> 02:54.500
LILIEL CRY
You can't donate

02:54.500 --> 02:55.780
LILIEL CRY
those porn books to the school!

02:59.930 --> 03:02.370
You are the club president,
but you didn't know this?

03:06.750 --> 03:08.340
It's my fault...

03:08.340 --> 03:10.550
It's my fault the club room will be gone...

03:12.370 --> 03:13.440
Senior!

03:14.550 --> 03:18.690
We're not allowed to use this room
because it will be a study group, right?

03:19.310 --> 03:24.470
Then, we might not be kicked out
if we do the club activities properly now.

03:24.470 --> 03:26.480
We see this in manga all the time!

03:27.410 --> 03:30.270
An otaku never backs down
when things get rough!

03:30.890 --> 03:32.260
Lilysa...

03:32.260 --> 03:33.890
We must give our best shot,

03:33.890 --> 03:38.090
and if it still doesn't work out...

03:39.540 --> 03:46.590
That's... If we really lose our club room,
please don't disappear too.

03:47.370 --> 03:48.540
I...

03:48.970 --> 03:51.420
...still want to keep cosplaying with you!

03:55.980 --> 03:57.750
You're so pathetic, Okumura!

03:57.750 --> 03:59.840
Don't make such a face for your junior!

04:01.530 --> 04:03.270
This is getting interesting!

04:03.270 --> 04:07.350
Oh! That's what Master Ash says
whenever he's in trouble!

04:08.020 --> 04:09.750
Senior!

04:11.060 --> 04:12.570
I'm the club president!

04:12.570 --> 04:15.150
I'll do anything for my club room!

04:15.150 --> 04:16.510
STUDENT COUNCIL OFFICE

04:16.510 --> 04:17.610
STUDENT COUNCIL OFFICE
Makes sense.

04:18.710 --> 04:21.070
There is no problem with extending
the use of the current club room

04:21.440 --> 04:25.020
as long as the requirements of your club
are met and the application is approved.

04:25.020 --> 04:26.230
Really?!

04:27.250 --> 04:29.500
There is a rigorous reviewing process,

04:29.500 --> 04:31.750
including a report
on the activities of the club,

04:31.750 --> 04:35.130
but without an advisor,
we can't do that.

04:35.590 --> 04:38.160
So I just need to find an advisor, right?

04:38.160 --> 04:40.690
If you find a teacher
who is willing to take on the job,

04:40.690 --> 04:43.600
please get their seal on this document.

04:43.910 --> 04:45.620
Here is a list of current clubs

04:45.620 --> 04:48.610
and their advisors for your reference.

04:48.960 --> 04:51.450
When you're ready to report after that,

04:51.450 --> 04:55.730
please contact us again,
and we can show you some examples.

04:55.730 --> 04:58.000
I apologize for everything.

04:58.000 --> 04:59.760
It's because of my ineptitude.

05:00.350 --> 05:06.080
Did you think that we were trying
to destroy the Manga Club?

05:06.080 --> 05:08.550
Eh? No, I didn't think that far...

05:08.550 --> 05:09.510
But...

05:09.510 --> 05:12.920
We, the student council,
are just enforcing the rules

05:12.920 --> 05:14.720
and have no malicious intent behind them.

05:14.720 --> 05:18.300
We are on the side of all students,
as long as they consult with us.

05:18.670 --> 05:21.570
If you have any problems,
please don't hesitate to come here again.

05:25.940 --> 05:28.250
The advisor, huh?

05:29.910 --> 05:31.150
Excuse me!

05:31.990 --> 05:35.400
Advisor? I'm already busy with my club!

05:35.890 --> 05:38.540
We just had a second baby, so I can't.

05:38.540 --> 05:39.860
Do you want to see a picture?

05:40.250 --> 05:41.990
You want me to overwork?!

05:42.630 --> 05:45.900
You don't need to accompany us
to practices or competitions...

05:45.900 --> 05:47.410
Even if it was only my name,

05:47.410 --> 05:50.450
I'd be barraged with all kinds of formalities,
documents, and meetings.

05:50.450 --> 05:53.910
You don't know how busy club advisors
are behind the scenes, do you?

05:56.030 --> 05:57.780
Thank you very much.

05:59.610 --> 06:00.380
Hmm?

06:03.350 --> 06:05.340
What is it, Okumura?

06:05.740 --> 06:08.160
You're looking for an advisor?

06:08.160 --> 06:10.180
Yes. But...

06:11.570 --> 06:13.810
You're in a desperate situation, aren't you?

06:14.240 --> 06:17.190
The new teacher, Ms. Hanyu,
doesn't have a club yet.

06:17.580 --> 06:19.280
Ms. Hanyu?

06:19.280 --> 06:21.990
Oh, you haven't met her yet?

06:22.400 --> 06:23.890
Mayuri, the home economics teacher.

06:23.890 --> 06:26.170
- She's a beautiful teacher.
- Hey, listen to me, Ms. Mayuri.

06:26.170 --> 06:27.520
Wow, good for you.

06:27.520 --> 06:28.950
I haven't said anything yet!

06:28.950 --> 06:32.390
Okay, okay, it's time for club activities.

06:34.340 --> 06:37.000
Are you Ms. Hanyu?

06:40.260 --> 06:42.580
Ah, the club advisor, huh?

06:43.110 --> 06:46.340
All the other teachers
had refused to take on the role.

06:47.780 --> 06:52.000
In April, it might have worked,
but it's now the middle of the semester.

06:52.000 --> 06:54.730
That's right.
Ms. Mayuri is really busy!

06:55.220 --> 06:57.590
I understand...

06:57.590 --> 06:59.060
Too bad for you.

06:59.060 --> 07:00.480
So it's useless...

07:00.480 --> 07:02.630
I'm sorry I can't help you.

07:02.630 --> 07:04.240
Ah, it's okay.

07:04.240 --> 07:07.180
Now, everyone,
it's time to go home or go to your club.

07:07.180 --> 07:08.850
Eh?

07:08.850 --> 07:11.390
Geez...

07:11.390 --> 07:14.410
What's up? Why're you staring
at your teacher like that?

07:14.410 --> 07:16.540
Ah, no. I'm sorry.

07:19.110 --> 07:23.260
I feel like I've seen
this teacher before...

07:23.260 --> 07:25.030
MILKY SUCCUBUS

07:25.030 --> 07:25.800
MILKY SUCCUBUS
Ah...

07:26.950 --> 07:27.510
Milky...

07:28.970 --> 07:29.760
Ah...

07:30.620 --> 07:31.730
"Milky"?

07:33.860 --> 07:35.860
Okumura, was it?

07:36.260 --> 07:37.250
Come here for a moment.

07:37.250 --> 07:37.770
Eh?

07:38.250 --> 07:39.730
Ms. Mayuri?!

07:41.130 --> 07:43.150
You little brat...
How did you know that name?

07:43.150 --> 07:44.690
I-I was right!

07:44.690 --> 07:46.360
- Mayura—
- Don't call me by that name!

07:46.360 --> 07:47.950
She's wilder than I imagined!

07:47.950 --> 07:50.510
I repeat: How did you know that name?

07:50.510 --> 07:52.070
Depending on your answer,

07:52.070 --> 07:55.250
you'll have to test the sharpness
of the freshly sharpened knives there.

07:55.250 --> 07:56.500
That's dangerous!

07:56.850 --> 07:58.640
M-Ms. Mayuri, more importantly...

07:58.640 --> 08:00.950
What? Did you come up
with your last will?

08:00.950 --> 08:02.000
So hasty!

08:02.710 --> 08:04.350
It's pressing me...

08:07.050 --> 08:08.220
Your milky...

08:08.220 --> 08:09.970
You're just messing with me, aren't you?!

08:09.970 --> 08:12.960
Please hear me out!
Our Manga Club...

08:13.850 --> 08:17.530
What?! Cosplay as a club activity?!

08:19.460 --> 08:20.880
That's amazing...

08:20.880 --> 08:21.760
Eh?

08:21.760 --> 08:23.360
Ah, no!

08:25.010 --> 08:28.710
No wonder that girl seemed so familiar.

08:30.260 --> 08:32.420
That junior high student...

08:32.580 --> 08:36.420
I can't tell if it's a miracle or an irony...

08:37.150 --> 08:41.420
We're in such a pinch that Lilysa
might not be able to cosplay anymore!

08:41.420 --> 08:42.140
So please, Milk—

08:42.510 --> 08:43.270
Ms. Hanyu!

08:43.270 --> 08:44.340
I'm really sorry.

08:44.870 --> 08:47.070
If that's the case,
I can't accept your request.

08:47.070 --> 08:47.800
What?

08:48.930 --> 08:53.310
I can't meet her.
Because I betrayed cosplay.

08:53.310 --> 08:54.760
You...

08:55.220 --> 08:56.550
...betrayed cosplay?

09:02.820 --> 09:05.270
You must've had a good reason, right?

09:07.360 --> 09:08.150
No!

09:08.490 --> 09:09.910
Isn't it already obvious?!

09:09.910 --> 09:11.990
I quit cosplaying
because I'm a teacher now!

09:11.990 --> 09:12.420
HOME ECONOMICS

09:12.420 --> 09:14.500
HOME ECONOMICS
It's not good for education if a teacher

09:14.500 --> 09:16.320
HOME ECONOMICS
sells her half-naked photo DVDs!

09:16.320 --> 09:19.830
HOME ECONOMICS
W-Well... You're right.

09:20.220 --> 09:23.930
There's no more reason than that...

09:23.930 --> 09:25.090
That's why...

09:25.490 --> 09:27.980
That's why I can't face her.

09:27.980 --> 09:29.050
Miss Mayura...

09:29.050 --> 09:32.510
- I told you not to call me by that name!
- Sorry! I'm sorry!

09:33.670 --> 09:35.250
I love cosplay.

09:35.680 --> 09:38.970
But I knew from the beginning that
it wasn't something I could do forever.

09:39.490 --> 09:42.650
Hobbies are hobbies,
and work is work.

09:42.650 --> 09:46.690
I chose a solid high school and college
and became a civil servant.

09:47.060 --> 09:47.820
Is that wrong?!

09:47.820 --> 09:49.900
Calm down!
Why are you so mad?!

09:52.430 --> 09:54.320
I'm a coward.

09:54.320 --> 09:55.020
Huh?

09:56.180 --> 09:59.120
I was prepared to quit
from the beginning,

09:59.850 --> 10:02.350
but when the time came,
I couldn't tell anyone...

10:04.470 --> 10:07.130
I left all my cosplayer friends behind

10:07.680 --> 10:09.860
and quietly got a job alone.

10:10.320 --> 10:13.340
I betrayed cosplay, and I came here.

10:14.010 --> 10:16.060
That's why I can't meet her.

10:16.060 --> 10:17.300
So just give it up.

10:17.700 --> 10:19.520
It's impossible to convince her, huh?

10:20.710 --> 10:22.050
I understand.

10:22.050 --> 10:25.410
I'll give up the club room
and give it to the new club.

10:25.820 --> 10:26.480
I'm sorry.

10:28.190 --> 10:30.480
But this is a big problem.

10:31.800 --> 10:34.270
Where did I put it?

10:34.270 --> 10:35.910
That Miss Mayura's cosrom.

10:36.560 --> 10:39.260
Are you serious?!
My cosrom is in this school?!

10:39.260 --> 10:42.500
Since it's impossible to bring
all the stuff in the club room,

10:42.970 --> 10:47.330
I'm thinking of giving it out
to the people who want to take it.

10:47.710 --> 10:51.010
So it can't be helped
if I hand it over to other students, right?

10:51.010 --> 10:54.020
You...! Are you trying to
blackmail your teacher?!

10:54.410 --> 10:56.220
I'm sorry, Ms. Mayuri!

10:56.700 --> 11:01.050
I have no other way to save
our club room for Lilysa's sake!

11:02.980 --> 11:03.850
I FOUND A TEACHER WHO MIGHT BE OUR ADVISOR!

11:03.850 --> 11:04.980
I FOUND A TEACHER WHO MIGHT BE OUR ADVISOR!
Listen! I'll only hear you guys out, okay?!

11:04.980 --> 11:06.150
I'LL BRING HER TO OUR CLUBROOM
Listen! I'll only hear you guys out, okay?!

11:06.150 --> 11:06.980
AND LET'S CONVINCE HER
Yes...

11:06.980 --> 11:08.210
YOU'RE THE BEST, SENIOR!
And don't tell her that I'm Mayura!

11:08.210 --> 11:08.980
I UNDERSTAND!
And don't tell her that I'm Mayura!

11:08.980 --> 11:10.550
And don't tell her that I'm Mayura!

11:10.550 --> 11:12.190
I-I understand...

11:12.950 --> 11:15.360
Lilysa! The teacher is he—

11:17.440 --> 11:20.470
I-I am Lilysa Amano,
a first-year student.

11:20.470 --> 11:21.790
I'm a cosplayer!

11:22.180 --> 11:23.840
Nice to meet you!

11:25.740 --> 11:27.280
You didn't change your costume?!

11:27.280 --> 11:30.590
I thought I should let the teacher
take a look at my cosplay.

11:30.590 --> 11:32.830
Well, maybe you're right...

11:32.830 --> 11:33.700
Ah.

11:33.700 --> 11:36.050
It's the beautiful teacher
from back then...

11:36.380 --> 11:38.270
She's grown into a splendid otaku!

11:38.270 --> 11:39.010
Ms. Mayuri?

11:39.010 --> 11:40.400
A Liliel cosplayer of this age?

11:40.400 --> 11:42.420
What a brave choice,
but not bad at all.

11:42.420 --> 11:44.010
Did you make this costume yourself?

11:44.010 --> 11:45.770
The edges are a little bit messy,

11:45.770 --> 11:48.140
but I can feel your love for the details.

11:48.660 --> 11:49.610
Ms. Mayuri?!

11:49.900 --> 11:52.560
Ms. Mayuri, you sure know
a lot about cosplay.

11:53.020 --> 11:54.330
That's not true!

11:54.330 --> 11:55.390
Like that lie would pass.

11:55.390 --> 11:57.200
And you should recognize her soon, Lilysa!

11:57.520 --> 12:00.720
I-I have a friend who is
into this kind of hobby.

12:00.720 --> 12:02.660
Ah, I see.

12:02.660 --> 12:04.160
Wait! That's...!

12:04.160 --> 12:06.530
MILKY SUCCUBUS
My proud but embarrassing first cosrom!

12:06.530 --> 12:08.500
MILKY SUCCUBUS
It's sitting right in the open!

12:08.500 --> 12:11.210
Okumura! You little...!

12:11.650 --> 12:14.410
A-Amano, what is this?

12:14.410 --> 12:15.130
Ah!

12:15.130 --> 12:16.920
- You can't bring this stuff...
- Ah, that's...!

12:17.360 --> 12:19.640
That's my most favorite cosrom!

12:22.070 --> 12:26.450
Miss Mayura's love for this character,
Lady Lastarotte, is amazing!

12:26.450 --> 12:28.270
The details of the costume, every pose,

12:28.270 --> 12:32.740
and every composition of the photo were
brimming with respect for the original work.

12:32.740 --> 12:34.300
She is the one who taught me

12:34.300 --> 12:38.380
how wonderful it is to express your love
for a certain work through cosplay!

12:39.410 --> 12:43.390
I wish I could do cosplay like her.

12:44.730 --> 12:47.840
D-Do you really like it that much?

12:47.840 --> 12:49.940
This cosrom...

12:50.890 --> 12:53.020
This is the thing
that I love most in the world!

12:53.020 --> 12:57.330
I'll be really happy if I can become
a cosplayer like Miss Mayura!

12:59.920 --> 13:01.050
Ms. Mayuri!

13:01.050 --> 13:04.480
We need the club room
to keep doing cosplay!

13:04.480 --> 13:07.420
Ah, sorry. That's right.

13:07.420 --> 13:09.840
It'll be really helpful
if you become our advisor...

13:09.840 --> 13:11.840
Is that all?

13:12.870 --> 13:15.150
My promise was just to hear you out, right?

13:15.150 --> 13:18.820
That aside, you shouldn't bring
things like this to school.

13:18.820 --> 13:20.790
I'm confiscating it.

13:28.410 --> 13:29.620
HOME ECONOMICS ROOM

13:36.380 --> 13:39.760
What is that precious creature?!
Is she an angel?!

13:39.760 --> 13:41.380
Did god send her for me?!

13:41.770 --> 13:44.250
I can't take it...
I want to hug her so bad!

13:44.250 --> 13:45.690
My motherly side is surfacing...!

13:45.690 --> 13:49.130
No, I don't feel like it'll satisfy me
no matter how much I hug her!

13:49.130 --> 13:50.600
What should I do?!

13:50.600 --> 13:53.190
Ah, money!
I want to give her my money!

13:53.190 --> 13:55.440
I want to endorse her!
Lilysa Amano!

13:55.440 --> 13:58.070
Since I'm a civil servant,
I have a high credit limit!

13:58.070 --> 13:58.560
LILYSA

13:58.560 --> 14:00.530
LILYSA
Ah, I love her...!

14:14.620 --> 14:16.270
Do you still want something from me?

14:16.270 --> 14:18.880
Please don't act like
I didn't see that.

14:20.350 --> 14:23.050
You really don't know
when to give up.

14:23.050 --> 14:24.720
It's for the sake of Lilysa's cosplay.

14:25.610 --> 14:28.100
Even if I'm going to be your advisor,

14:28.100 --> 14:30.490
I don't guarantee that
the club room will be protected.

14:30.490 --> 14:31.060
Huh?

14:31.490 --> 14:34.310
I've heard rumors because
it's a famous story.

14:34.310 --> 14:36.480
The retired Manga Club advisor,
Mr. Fujimoto,

14:36.480 --> 14:37.830
MANGA KOSHIEN
had the Manga Club participate

14:37.830 --> 14:39.170
MANGA KOSHIEN
in the Manga Koshien

14:39.170 --> 14:41.470
MANGA KOSHIEN
and achieve good results every year.

14:41.470 --> 14:43.030
That's why they could
secure their club status.

14:43.570 --> 14:48.050
You two won't be able to pass
the activity report even with an advisor.

14:48.050 --> 14:50.740
Come to think of it,
my seniors did that.

14:53.050 --> 14:54.400
I'll do something about it!

14:55.370 --> 14:57.840
I want Lilysa to be able
to keep doing cosplay!

14:58.210 --> 15:01.210
Or rather, I want to keep doing
cosplay together with her!

15:03.490 --> 15:05.900
You really don't know
when to give up.

15:06.300 --> 15:08.270
Even I feel the same.

15:08.800 --> 15:09.930
Ms. Mayuri?

15:10.340 --> 15:13.010
I want to see more of that girl's cosplay!

15:13.010 --> 15:14.430
Isn't that your selfish desire?!

15:15.500 --> 15:17.730
Okay, fine. I give up.

15:17.730 --> 15:19.920
I'll at least submit the report for you.

15:19.920 --> 15:21.370
Really?!

15:21.370 --> 15:22.400
In exchange...

15:22.770 --> 15:25.260
I want you to promise me one thing.

15:27.580 --> 15:29.920
Give me Lilysa's cosrom
whenever you make some.

15:29.920 --> 15:32.140
You can have as many as you want.

15:34.090 --> 15:36.410
Activity report, huh?

15:36.410 --> 15:42.000
Yeah. We can't just report that
we're making erotic ROMs, right?

15:43.390 --> 15:46.500
You're right.
I'm sorry about that.

15:46.500 --> 15:48.680
N-No, it's not your fault!

15:49.040 --> 15:52.320
This is a mistake that the past
Manga Club has made, including me.

15:52.320 --> 15:56.890
Anyway, let's think of healthy activities
that we can report to the principal.

15:56.890 --> 15:58.520
Y-You're right!

15:58.870 --> 16:02.320
For now, let's try making a manga,
just like a Manga Club does.

16:02.320 --> 16:02.980
What?!

16:04.700 --> 16:06.800
Are you going to make a Liliel manga?!

16:06.800 --> 16:07.770
Certainly.

16:07.770 --> 16:10.530
I have always wanted to draw one.

16:10.910 --> 16:14.240
I've wanted to draw the behind-the-scenes
of the original work!

16:14.240 --> 16:16.930
Wow! I really want to read it!

16:17.630 --> 16:19.020
Just leave it to me!

16:20.580 --> 16:22.130
Ms. Hanyu!

16:22.130 --> 16:23.670
How're things going?

16:24.020 --> 16:26.630
Thank you for being our advisor!

16:30.110 --> 16:31.350
Then, I'll take my leave now.

16:31.350 --> 16:32.720
Don't take her home with you!

16:34.580 --> 16:36.830
Oh? So you want to draw a manga?

16:36.830 --> 16:38.590
Please give us some advice!

16:38.590 --> 16:40.470
Even though I'm your advisor,

16:40.470 --> 16:42.690
I don't really know much
about this kind of thing.

16:43.210 --> 16:44.610
Is this the storyboard?

16:44.610 --> 16:48.070
24 pages of AshXLili complex love manga?

16:48.070 --> 16:49.660
I used to read that one.

16:50.060 --> 16:52.830
If you want to submit it
for Summer Comiket you should finish it

16:52.830 --> 16:55.620
around the first week of July.

16:56.030 --> 16:59.950
You can output in a format that can be
submitted directly to a printing studio,

16:59.950 --> 17:01.500
so it's really fast and convenient.

17:01.500 --> 17:03.710
You're way too informed
for just a club advisor.

17:04.560 --> 17:05.990
Let me see.

17:06.160 --> 17:08.220
MASTER ASHFORD!

17:08.960 --> 17:12.160
I guess it doesn't matter how bad
it is since you're a beginner...

17:12.160 --> 17:15.060
But I think it's cute, Senior!

17:15.970 --> 17:17.160
I guess it's really not good enough.

17:17.160 --> 17:17.520
I guess it's really not good enough.
MASTER ASHFORD!
I guess not everyone gets to pour

17:17.520 --> 17:20.840
MASTER ASHFORD!
I guess not everyone gets to pour

17:20.840 --> 17:22.730
I AM HERE FOR YOU!
their love into fan art.

17:23.840 --> 17:24.960
You're amazing, Lilysa.

17:26.290 --> 17:29.070
You can do such a good cosplay
of something I admire.

17:29.070 --> 17:30.850
Senior...

17:33.440 --> 17:34.740
By the way...

17:34.740 --> 17:35.660
AFTER-SCHOOL CLASS PROGRAM

17:35.660 --> 17:37.170
AFTER-SCHOOL CLASS PROGRAM
I got this invitation.

17:37.170 --> 17:38.200
AFTER-SCHOOL CLASS PROGRAM
Do you want to go?

17:39.670 --> 17:44.170
After-school class program...
A story-telling volunteer, huh?

17:44.820 --> 17:47.580
Since you guys love manga,

17:47.580 --> 17:51.550
I'm sure the kids would love it
if you read the story from one of them.

17:51.990 --> 17:54.560
It's like community service, right?

17:59.270 --> 18:00.660
Let's do it, Liliel!

18:00.660 --> 18:02.650
Yes, Master Ashford!

18:02.650 --> 18:05.150
It's now or never!
You have to stand up to them!

18:06.030 --> 18:08.010
No one's listening...

18:08.010 --> 18:11.060
Were elementary schoolers
always this rowdy?

18:11.060 --> 18:13.910
I'm sorry, although you've taken
your time to come.

18:13.910 --> 18:17.120
No! This is because we lack
enthusiasm and technique!

18:17.420 --> 18:18.610
We need more seriousness!

18:18.610 --> 18:20.940
I'll try raising my voice!

18:20.940 --> 18:21.730
Aaah!

18:21.730 --> 18:23.190
- Aah! Master Ashford!
- I never thought that

18:23.190 --> 18:24.930
- Aah! Master Ashford!
- I would get such stoic students.

18:32.470 --> 18:34.930
Ah, let's do our best for tomorrow!

18:34.930 --> 18:36.470
Y-Yeah...

18:37.470 --> 18:41.150
This cannot be an activity report...

18:41.150 --> 18:43.030
We have to do something...

18:43.810 --> 18:44.390
Ah...

18:45.310 --> 18:46.290
Lilysa!

18:49.360 --> 18:52.130
Attention, everyone!

18:52.130 --> 18:54.990
A wonderful guest is visiting us today!

19:01.370 --> 19:03.840
Hello everyone!

19:03.840 --> 19:05.670
It's me, Liliel!

19:05.670 --> 19:06.550
It's Liliel!

19:06.550 --> 19:07.660
Amazing!

19:07.660 --> 19:08.130
Liliel!

19:08.130 --> 19:10.310
I'm watching the anime!

19:10.310 --> 19:11.330
Thank you.

19:11.330 --> 19:12.500
You have a boyfriend?

19:12.500 --> 19:13.660
No.

19:16.970 --> 19:21.810
This is a story about a swordsman,
Ashford, and an angel, Liliel.

19:31.850 --> 19:35.650
As long as everyone cheers for me,
I'll never give up!

19:36.560 --> 19:37.870
The end.

19:38.410 --> 19:39.600
Ms. Liliel!

19:39.600 --> 19:40.460
- Once again!
- I was surprised

19:40.460 --> 19:41.370
- That was fun!
- I was surprised

19:41.370 --> 19:42.370
- Read it again!
- when she said she wanted to cosplay.

19:42.370 --> 19:43.890
But this is amazing.

19:43.890 --> 19:46.080
She can gather everyone's attention quickly!

19:46.970 --> 19:47.850
Yes.

19:48.460 --> 19:50.810
Maybe I should do cosplay too next time.

19:50.810 --> 19:51.550
Just kidding!

19:52.160 --> 19:53.770
I'll lend you a costume!

19:57.220 --> 20:00.000
Great! I got good photos too!

20:00.000 --> 20:02.130
I don't know if this report
will pass or not,

20:02.130 --> 20:04.850
but at least we have a pretty
good report now.

20:06.590 --> 20:07.510
Lilysa?

20:07.510 --> 20:08.400
Ah...

20:08.860 --> 20:11.150
Ah, yes, you're right...

20:26.320 --> 20:29.700
My anime watchlist keeps growing...

20:29.700 --> 20:31.590
I haven't caught up
with the previous season.

20:32.190 --> 20:34.250
The world is leaving me behind...

20:35.550 --> 20:36.380
INCOMING CALL: ERI

20:36.380 --> 20:37.130
INCOMING CALL: ERI
Eri?

20:41.050 --> 20:42.350
Long time no hear.

20:43.300 --> 20:44.510
I'm sorry...

20:45.450 --> 20:47.670
Why are you apologizing?

20:47.670 --> 20:48.970
Do you remember that girl?

20:48.970 --> 20:50.310
I met her.

20:50.310 --> 20:52.050
She came to the event.

20:52.650 --> 20:54.900
Lily—
You met that girl?

20:54.900 --> 20:57.700
Yes. She's so cute.

20:57.700 --> 20:59.820
She said to meet again at Summer Comiket.

21:01.120 --> 21:02.220
I see.

21:03.210 --> 21:04.580
You're not coming?

21:06.310 --> 21:08.540
You haven't worn
that costume yet, have you?

21:09.670 --> 21:10.620
I threw it away.

21:10.620 --> 21:13.750
You're lying.
No way would you ever do that.

21:14.610 --> 21:16.250
There's no way I could wear it.

21:16.950 --> 21:18.940
I'm a teacher now, you know?

21:19.840 --> 21:21.180
But you want to wear it, right?

21:23.940 --> 21:25.220
Say, Eri...

21:25.650 --> 21:27.500
Why did I spend my life

21:27.500 --> 21:31.540
doing something I'm ashamed
to tell people about?

21:33.310 --> 21:34.460
Mayura...

21:35.910 --> 21:37.900
I still want to do cosplay...

21:38.510 --> 21:41.730
But... I can't keep putting my life on hold.

21:49.420 --> 21:51.760
I drank too much last night...

21:54.590 --> 21:56.800
To keep alive, huh?

21:57.750 --> 21:58.940
MANGA CLUB

21:58.940 --> 22:00.470
MANGA CLUB
Thank you both for your efforts.

22:01.200 --> 22:03.900
The feedback from
the volunteer work is really good.

22:03.900 --> 22:05.840
I see your report is ready.

22:05.840 --> 22:06.430
No...

22:12.900 --> 22:13.930
Ms. Mayuri!

22:15.580 --> 22:18.570
We won't submit this report!

22:19.070 --> 22:20.310
Eh?

23:55.040 --> 24:01.120
DO YOU LOVE COSPLAY?
